WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.263
Stand tall, dumbbells in front of your thighs, knees soft.

2
00:00:02.263 --> 00:00:04.527
Push your hips back until your torso is parallel to the floor.

3
00:00:04.527 --> 00:00:06.790
Keep your back flat and drive your hips forward to stand fully upright.
